# 2026-08-05 on a box that booted 2026-07-10 and never rebooted since. `uname
# -v` is in the first handful of commands almost every visitor runs -- one ran
# it forty seconds after this was found. Derived from BOOT_TS so the ordering
# holds however the boot time is regenerated. Filled in below BOOT_TS.
