# Deliberately NOT listed, because a Debian 12 server genuinely does not ship
# them and "command not found" is the correct answer: lsof, strace, ltrace,
# file, strings, nm, objdump, readelf (binutils), dig/host/nslookup (dnsutils),
# traceroute, netstat/arp/route/ifconfig (net-tools), nc (netcat), bzip2,
# unzip, iostat/sar/mpstat (sysstat), iptables (nftables replaced it).
